   "title": "PATCH HIGHLIGHTS",
   "role": null,
   "description": null,
   "dev": null,
   "heroes": [],
   "blocks": [
    {
     "title": "New Seasonal Event: Halloween Terror 2018",
     "body": "The fright for the future returns!\n\nIn addition to playing the limited-time brawl, you'll also be able to unlock new seasonal items—including six new legendary skins like Banshee Moira, Jack-o’-lantern Wrecking Ball, and Enchanted Armor Pharah—alongside our growing collection of bone-chilling gear from previous years.\n\nLearn more about Halloween Terror here .",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Color Blind Option Updates",
     "body": "Customize how team colors are displayed in your user interface (e.g. nameplates, HUD, health bars, and hero outlines) with a set of nine different colorblind-friendly colors to choose from. You can also colorize enemy and friendly UI separately. These options can be found under Options > Video > Color Blind Options. All changes made will be saved and ready for you to see in the next match you play!",
     "dev": null
    }
   ],
   "maps": []
  },
  {
   "type": "generic_update",
   "title": "GENERAL UPDATES",
   "role": null,
   "description": null,
   "dev": null,
   "heroes": [],
   "blocks": [
    {
     "title": "General",
     "body": "- Updated the audio mix to add more clarity and dynamic range for all sounds in the game",
     "dev": "We’ve added more heroes and features to the game, so the audio mix has become more complex, which required us to rebalance sounds across the game. In this update, we extended the range of third-person weapon sounds, increased the range of first-person weapon impacts in the world, and generally balanced third-person footsteps and ability sounds."
    }
   ],
   "maps": []
  },
